        "answer": {
          "short": "$2(e+2)$, $2e+4$",
          "worked": "The new total is $e+2$. Doubling it adds two copies:\n$$\\begin{align*}(e+2)+(e+2)&=2e+4\\end{align*}$$\nThe matching expressions are $2(e+2)$ and $2e+4$.",
